::: {.tip}
**Note:** Many server BIOS configurations have PXE network booting configured
as the primary option in the boot order by default. If your compute nodes have
a different device as the first in the sequence, the `ipmitool` utility
can be used to enable PXE.

```bash
[sms]# ipmitool -E -I lanplus -H ${bmc_ipaddr} -U root chassis \
	bootdev pxe options=persistent
```
:::
